%%text The tune "Female Saylor" was composed as "Marche pour les Matelots" (March for the Sailors)
%%text by Marin Marais for his opera Alcione (1706), and quickly became a popular dance tune.
%%text The words to the carol "Masters in This Hall", set to this tune, were written much later,
%%text around 1860, by William Morris. 